<div>

<div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>

<div style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: bold">REWALK ROBOTICS LTD.<br/> FORM 10-K FOR THE YEAR ENDED DECEMBER&#160;31,
