</div>

<div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>

<div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: bold">Obligations and Commercial Commitments</div>

<div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>

<div style="text-indent: 36pt; line-height: 1.25">Set forth below is a summary of our contractual obligations as of December&#160;31,
2023:</div>

