        <div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;line-height:1.25;font-family:'Times New Roman',Times,serif"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">During the twelve months ended December 31, 2023, 2022, and 2021, the Company recognized, at cost of revenues, reserves for excess and obsolete in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20230221162309076" name="us-gaap:InventoryWriteDown" contextRef="C_20230101to20231231" unitRef="USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">398 </ix:nonFraction>thousand, $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20230221162316072" name="us-gaap:InventoryWriteDown" contextRef="C_20220101to20221231" unitRef="USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">502</ix:nonFraction> thousand, and $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20230221162319494" name="us-gaap:InventoryWriteDown" contextRef="C_20210101to20211231" unitRef="USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">252</ix:nonFraction> thousand, respectively.</span></span></div>
