                <div><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">Represents warrants for ordinary shares issuable upon an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20230213221744619" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="C_20151231_usgaapRelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_lfwdKreosCapitalMember" unitRef="USD_per_Share" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">7.500</ix:nonFraction> per share, which were granted on <ix:nonNumeric id="FFact_0000000000850" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRighstDateFromWhichWarrantsOrRightsExercisable" contextRef="C_20150101to20151231_deiLegalEntityAxis_lfwdKreosCapitalVMember" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en">December 31, 2015</ix:nonNumeric> to Kreos Capital V (Expert) Fund Limited (&#8220;Kreos&#8221;) in connection with a loan made by Kreos to the Company and are <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20230214153827207" name="lfwd:WarrantsExercisableDescrition" contextRef="C_20150101to20151231_deiLegalEntityAxis_lfwdKreosCapitalVMember">currently exercisable (in whole or in part) until the earlier of (i) December 30, 2025 or (ii) immediately prior to the consummation of a merger, consolidation, or reorganization of the Company with or into, or the sale or license of all or substantially all the assets or shares of the Company to, any other entity or person, other than a wholly owned subsidiary of the Company, excluding any transaction in which the Company&#8217;s shareholders prior to the transaction will hold more than 50% of the voting and economic rights of the surviving entity after the transaction. None of these warrants had been exercised as of December 31, 2023.</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></div>
              </td>
            </tr>

        </table>
