                <div><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">Represents warrants that were issued to certain institutional purchasers in a private placement in the Company&#8217;s best efforts offering of ordinary shares in February 2020. As of December 31, 2023, <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20230221045623403" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" contextRef="C_20221231_lfwdAgreementAxis_lfwdCertainInstitutionalPurchasersMember_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_lfwdOfferingOfOrdinarySharesInFebruary2020Member" unitRef="shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">3,740,100</ix:nonFraction> warrants were exercised for total consideration of $<ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20230221045640309" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromWarrantExercises" contextRef="C_20220101to20221231_lfwdAgreementAxis_lfwdCertainInstitutionalPurchasersMember_usgaapClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_lfwdOfferingOfOrdinarySharesInFebruary2020Member" unitRef="USD" scale="3" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">4,675,125</ix:nonFraction>. During the twelve months that ended December 31, 2023, no warrants were exercised.</span></span></div>
